  "GAP CLOSED 2026-08-31: the three Oracle boards recorded above as unreadable (Honeywell, Vertiv, CSX) all answered the shipped oracle-orc adapter. The correction was that limit and offset go INSIDE the finder string, not beside it. CSX, previously a gap, turned out to hold nine paid Summer 2027 internships; its Mechanical Engineering one is now entry ats-049. Oracle postings are in the recall denominator instead of a footnote.",
